        {
          "block_label": "text",
          "block_content": "Mr Wilson added everything up.Herchildren were right.\"Well done,\"she said.\"Next time we' do the soppingnearby.\"① The things at the corner store were than those in the supermaket.A.cheaper B.nicer C.more expensive D. better ② Mrs. Wilson in the end.\n",
          "block_bbox": [
            199,
            363,
            1999,
            798
          ],
          "block_id": 1,
          "block_order": 1
        },
        {
          "block_label": "text",
          "block_content": "A.spend more money B.paid less money C. lost some money D. saved a little money ",
          "block_bbox": [
            263,
            838,
            1807,
            1007
          ],
          "block_id": 2,
          "block_order": 2
        },
        {
          "block_label": "text",
          "block_content": "这两个问题都是细节性问题，但又不能直接从文中得出答案，要经过分析和计算间接地获得事实细节。①选C。由Ms.Wilsn的话\"Because they are cheaper here than at the corner store near our home.\"分析可知the things at the corner store were more expensive.②选A.Mrs.Wilson在超市买的东西便宜，但返回时由于东西多，打的士回家，这个费用摊4.扩大英语阅读量\n",
          "block_bbox": [
            198,
            1014,
            1998,
            1583
          ],
          "block_id": 3,
          "block_order": 3
        },
        {
          "block_label": "paragraph_title",
          "block_content": "4.扩大英语阅读量",
          "block_bbox": [
            198,
            1587,
            695,
            1668
          ],
          "block_id": 4,
          "block_order": 4
        },
        {
          "block_label": "text",
          "block_content": "目前初中英语教科书所提供的阅读量较以前有较大幅度的增加，在题材、体裁的选取，功能与话题的设计方面均注意多样化和广泛性；内容贴近学生实际。我们通过课内课外广泛的阅读不仅有利于扩大词汇量，丰富语言知识，开阔视野，开拓思路，还有利于了解英美等国的文化背景、生活风俗、思维习惯及英语特有的语言表达方式，从而提高阅读理解能力。\n",
          "block_bbox": [
            200,
            1681,
            1995,
            2235
          ],
          "block_id": 5,
          "block_order": 5
        },
        {
          "block_label": "paragraph_title",
          "block_content": "5.强化阅读训练",
          "block_bbox": [
            207,
            2253,
            685,
            2331
          ],
          "block_id": 6,
          "block_order": 6
        },
        {
          "block_label": "text",
          "block_content": "(1)指定阅读范围：根据不同的英语水平选择相适应的英语读物，自行安排时间，带着问题快速阅读。\n",
          "block_bbox": [
            204,
            2341,
            1995,
            2522
          ],
          "block_id": 7,
          "block_order": 7
        },
        {
          "block_label": "text",
          "block_content": "(2)进行阅读咨询：在阅读过程中遇到的疑难，及时咨询老师，以帮助阅读顺利完成。\n",
          "block_bbox": [
            202,
            2533,
            2000,
            2707
          ],
          "block_id": 8,
          "block_order": 8
        },
        {
          "block_label": "text",
          "block_content": "(3)检查阅读效果：阅读后通过口头练习和笔试的形式检查阅读完成",
          "block_bbox": [
            198,
            2718,
            1981,
            2803
          ],
          "block_id": 9,
          "block_order": 9
        },
        {
          "block_label": "number",
